 decision/live-rig-mcp-arm-keeps-no-output · Live rig's MCP arm keeps no CLI output — The live rig's MCP recording arm keeps no CLI output, stdout drained and dropped and stderr kept only as a byte count and a SHA, and its MCP config is a private 0600 file inside the scratch, removed with it.
+decision/live-rig-wake-arm-reads-own-wheel-lines · Live rig's R3W arm reads only viola's own wheel lines — The live rig's R3W arm reads from the events log in its own scratch home only viola's own wheel lines and the prompt's origin word, and records the captured prompt's key names, never their values.
 decision/live-session-screens-kept-local · Live session screens kept local — A live session's screen frames are kept only under a gitignored local path, never in a work dir, a run dir or a commit; what lands is a closed-word summary per frame. · why: A real session's screen holds the user's own status-line output and the repository is public.
@@ -608,3 +610,3 @@
 decision/fixture-hygiene · Recorded fixture hygiene — Recorded claude fixtures are never committed from sessions with real prompts, nor before being checked for home paths and usernames.
